{"seq":2,"slug":"authoritative-server","title":"权威服务器模型设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/authoritative-server","wordCount":1613,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"权威服务器模型设计\">权威服务器模型设计</h1><p>权威服务器（Authoritative Server）是现代多人游戏网络架构的核心原则：客户端发送输入，服务器决定结果，任何客户端都无权单方面声明&quot;我击中了对方&quot;或&quot;我获得了物品&quot;。这一原则划定了信任边界，是防作弊的根基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>权威模型的本质是<strong>信任边界划分</strong>：将游戏世界切分为&quot;不可信区域&quot;（客户端）和&quot;可信区域&quot;（服务器），所有状态变更必须经过可信区域的校验和裁决。服务器通过分层输入校验管线（频率→物理→状态前置→行为统计）过滤非法输入，通过事件溯源保证可审计可回放，通过部分权威分级在安全性与性能之间取得平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信任边界的本质\">信任边界的本质</h2><p>信任模型的核心问题是：游戏世界中的每一个状态变更，由谁来裁决？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 不可信区域&#10;        C1[客户端A: 输入采集]&#10;        C2[客户端B: 输入采集]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 可信区域&#10;        S[权威服务器: 模拟+裁决]&#10;        DB[(持久化存储)]&#10;    end&#10;    C1 --&gt;|&quot;键鼠输入 + 序列号&quot;| S&#10;    C2 --&gt;|&quot;键鼠输入 + 序列号&quot;| S&#10;    S --&gt;|&quot;权威状态快照&quot;| C1&#10;    S --&gt;|&quot;权威状态快照&quot;| C2&#10;    S --&gt;|&quot;关键事件&quot;| DB\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 不可信区域\n        C1[客户端A: 输入采集]\n        C2[客户端B: 输入采集]\n    end\n    subgraph 可信区域\n        S[权威服务器: 模拟+裁决]\n        DB[(持久化存储)]\n    end\n    C1 --&gt;|\"键鼠输入 + 序列号\"| S\n    C2 --&gt;|\"键鼠输入 + 序列号\"| S\n    S --&gt;|\"权威状态快照\"| C1\n    S --&gt;|\"权威状态快照\"| C2\n    S --&gt;|\"关键事件\"| DB</pre><p><strong>不可信区域</strong>（客户端）可以做的事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>采集输入（键盘、鼠标、手柄）</li>\n<li>本地预测（提升手感，但不作为最终结果）</li>\n<li>渲染表现层（特效、音效、UI）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不可信区域</strong>不能做的事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>决定命中判定结果</li>\n<li>修改伤害数值</li>\n<li>触发状态变更（死亡、复活、物品获取）</li>\n<li>修改其他玩家的任何属性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"权威服务器的处理管线\">权威服务器的处理管线</h2><p>服务器每个 Tick 按固定顺序执行以下管线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>失败处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 收集输入</td>\n<td>从网络缓冲区读取所有客户端的 Command</td>\n<td>超时未到达 → 使用上一帧输入或空输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 校验合法性</td>\n<td>速度校验、频率校验、状态前置条件</td>\n<td>非法输入 → 丢弃并记录异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 模拟世界</td>\n<td>物理步进、碰撞检测、游戏逻辑</td>\n<td>异常 → 回滚到上一帧安全状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 生成快照</td>\n<td>序列化当前世界状态为网络可传输格式</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 广播</td>\n<td>向每个客户端发送裁剪后的状态</td>\n<td>发送失败 → 标记断线重连</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"输入校验的层次\">输入校验的层次</h2><p>服务器对客户端输入的校验必须分层进行，每一层捕获不同类型的作弊行为：</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：频率校验</strong></p>\n<p>客户端发送输入的频率不应超过服务器 Tick Rate 的合理倍数。如果服务器运行在 64Hz，客户端每秒发送超过 128 个输入包就是异常信号。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层：物理合法性</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"距离校验：|新位置 - 旧位置| ≤ 最大速度 × Δt × (1 + 网络抖动余量)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>距离校验：|新位置 - 旧位置| ≤ 最大速度 × Δt × (1 + 网络抖动余量)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型实现中，网络抖动余量设为 20%：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\max} = v_{\\max} \\times \\Delta t \\times 1.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果客户端报告的位移超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，服务器拒绝该移动并将玩家拉回上一个合法位置。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层：状态前置条件</strong></p>\n<p>每个动作都有执行条件。开火需要：弹药 &gt; 0、武器冷却完成、角色非死亡状态、非眩晕状态。服务器维护这些状态的权威副本，客户端无法篡改。</p>\n<p><strong>第四层：行为统计异常</strong></p>\n<p>跨多帧统计分析——命中率异常高、反应时间异常短、视角转动不符合人体工学曲线。这一层通常离线分析而非实时阻断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权威模型的延迟代价\">权威模型的延迟代价</h2><p>纯权威模型引入的固有延迟是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>response</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>client→server</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>server_tick</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>server→client</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{response}} = T_{\\text{client→server}} + T_{\\text{server\\_tick}} + T_{\\text{server→client}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">response</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">client→server</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">server_tick</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">server→client</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于 50ms ping 的玩家，假设服务器 Tick 间隔 16ms（64Hz），最坏情况下响应延迟：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>worst</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext>ms</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mtext>ms</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext>ms</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>66</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{worst}} = 25\\text{ms} + 16\\text{ms} + 25\\text{ms} = 66\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">worst</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">66</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个延迟对于操作反馈是不可接受的，因此需要客户端预测（Client-Side Prediction）来掩盖等待时间。但预测的正确性仍由服务器裁决——预测错误时客户端必须回滚到服务器的权威状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分权威-vs-完全权威\">部分权威 vs 完全权威</h2><p>实际工程中，并非所有状态都需要完全由服务器控制。根据安全敏感度可以划分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态类型</th>\n<th>权威级别</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关键竞技状态</td>\n<td>完全服务器权威</td>\n<td>生命值、击杀判定、物品归属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动状态</td>\n<td>服务器校验 + 客户端预测</td>\n<td>位置、速度、跳跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表现状态</td>\n<td>客户端权威</td>\n<td>视角朝向、表情动作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯本地状态</td>\n<td>不同步</td>\n<td>UI 布局、音效音量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种分层设计在减少服务器负载的同时保持了关键状态的安全性。表现状态允许客户端自主决定，因为篡改它不会带来竞技优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件溯源模式\">事件溯源模式</h2><p>高级的权威服务器实现采用事件溯源（Event Sourcing）模式：服务器不直接修改状态，而是生成不可变的事件序列。状态是事件序列的投影。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务器&#10;    participant ES as 事件存储&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: Input(fire, seq=42, target_pos)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: Validate → Simulate → Hit confirmed&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;ES: Event(DamageDealt, player_B, 25hp, tick=1847)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: Snapshot(tick=1847, ack_seq=42)&#10;    Note over ES: 事件不可变,可重放审计\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务器\n    participant ES as 事件存储\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: Input(fire, seq=42, target_pos)\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: Validate → Simulate → Hit confirmed\n    S-&gt;&gt;ES: Event(DamageDealt, player_B, 25hp, tick=1847)\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: Snapshot(tick=1847, ack_seq=42)\n    Note over ES: 事件不可变,可重放审计</pre><p>事件溯源的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>回放与审计</strong>：任何争议都可以通过重放事件序列精确复现</li>\n<li><strong>反作弊取证</strong>：完整事件日志是封号决策的证据链</li>\n<li><strong>状态恢复</strong>：服务器崩溃后从最近的快照 + 后续事件重建状态</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多服务器间的权威分割\">多服务器间的权威分割</h2><p>当游戏世界过大无法由单台服务器承载时，需要在多个服务器之间分割权威。典型策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>空间分割</strong>：不同地图区域由不同服务器负责，玩家跨区时执行权威迁移</li>\n<li><strong>逻辑分割</strong>：战斗服务器、社交服务器、交易服务器各自对其领域拥有权威</li>\n<li><strong>分片（Sharding）</strong>：同一区域多个平行实例，玩家被路由到负载最低的分片</li>\n</ul>\n<p>跨服务器的权威迁移是最复杂的工程挑战之一——必须保证原子性（玩家不会同时存在于两个服务器的权威范围内）和一致性（迁移过程中的输入不会丢失）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>权威服务器是多人游戏公平性的根基。它通过将裁决权集中到服务器、对客户端输入分层校验、利用事件溯源实现可审计性，构建了一个即使客户端被完全攻破也能守住游戏诚信的架构。代价是固有的响应延迟（需要客户端预测来弥补）和多服务器权威分割时的复杂性。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"server-models-overview\">服务器模型总览</a>对比三种模型的选型维度；<a href=\"server-tick-loop\">服务器 Tick 循环</a>详解每 tick 的执行管线实现。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"权威服务器模型设计","id":"权威服务器模型设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"信任边界的本质","id":"信任边界的本质"},{"level":2,"text":"权威服务器的处理管线","id":"权威服务器的处理管线"},{"level":2,"text":"输入校验的层次","id":"输入校验的层次"},{"level":2,"text":"权威模型的延迟代价","id":"权威模型的延迟代价"},{"level":2,"text":"部分权威 vs 完全权威","id":"部分权威-vs-完全权威"},{"level":2,"text":"事件溯源模式","id":"事件溯源模式"},{"level":2,"text":"多服务器间的权威分割","id":"多服务器间的权威分割"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"游戏服务器模型总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/server-models-overview"},"next":{"title":"服务器 Tick 循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/server-tick-loop"}}